NAME
    gcloud beta observability scopes - manage Scope resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta observability scopes COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Scope resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Describe scopes.

     update
        (BETA) Update scopes.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud observability scopes

        $ gcloud alpha observability scopes

